  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5f7201a12d95ffc409449d95f23cf332, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 0, g: 1, b: 0.5019608, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_FontData:
    m_Font: {fileID: 12800000, guid: d8a7948bc83b01f45ab5078c10dd8e04, type: 3}
    m_FontSize: 80
    m_FontStyle: 0
    m_BestFit: 0
    m_MinSize: 0
    m_MaxSize: 118
    m_Alignment: 1
    m_AlignByGeometry: 0
    m_RichText: 0
    m_HorizontalOverflow: 1
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: '

    Any ball can be sunk in any order.



    All balls call shot.



    Fouls
    will cost you points.



    After a foul, it''s a status quo start. (Not a free
    ball)



    In case of a scratch, it is a free ball in the kitchen. (If the
    ball hits the target ball in the kitchen, it is a foul.)







    A dunked
    invalid ball returns to the foot.



























    After the cue
    ball hits the target ball, none of the cue balls or the target ball hits the
    cushion. (no cushion foul)



    The cueball does not hit any of the targets.
    (no hit)



    If the cue ball is pocketed, it is a foul even if the target
    ball is pocketed. (scratch)

'
